# Work on staging

This repo is personal for now. Do day-to-day git work on `staging`.

- Commit and push to `origin/staging`.
- Do not open a feature branch unless the user asks.
- Do not merge to `main` unless the user asks.
- Do not change Gandi apex or www DNS.

Stop this rule when the user says to leave staging.
